00:05:31.936 --> 00:05:33.427
- There's a very simple answer.

00:05:33.427 --> 00:05:36.777
Most people say, what college
did you graduate from?

00:05:37.207 --> 00:05:38.809
Not what was your GPA.

00:05:39.023 --> 00:05:41.944
