flexibility to become a massive

00:05:47.928 --> 00:05:49.676
Youtube sensation.

00:05:49.676 --> 00:05:52.311
- [Voiceover] Chelsea asks,
what are your thoughts about

00:05:52.311 --> 00:05:53.983
Facebook banning like-gating soon?

00:05:54.866 --> 00:05:56.576
- Chelsea, I actually think this--

00:05:56.576 --> 00:05:59.928
Look, I think Facebook out of, gets--

00:05:59.928 --> 00:06:01.849
I think Facebook is maybe one of the worst

00:06:01.849 --> 00:06:03.562
PR'd companies in the world.

00:06:04.415 --> 00:06:07.602
They've done so much more
good than people realize.

00:06:08.113 --> 00:06:11.979
They are the gold standard
of the future of marketing

00:06:11.979 --> 00:06:14.475
because they do so many
things for their users

00:06:14.475 --> 00:06:16.449
because their users are
their business and they

00:06:16.449 --> 00:06:17.586
understand it.

00:06:17.586 --> 00:06:20.373
By not allowing brands
to like-gate, where like,

00:06:20.373 --> 00:06:23.751
call like hard-core like
actions, they're actually

00:06:23.751 --> 00:06:26.329
helping brands and businesses
and small businesses

00:06:26.329 --> 00:06:28.430
understand that it's
not about getting people

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:33.097
to like be rewarded with
a free crown if you like,

00:06:33.097 --> 00:06:35.199
if you subscribe to this show.

00:06:36.302 --> 00:06:37.138
(tinkling)

00:06:37.138 --> 00:06:38.052
Here, you understand what
I'm doing here right here.

00:06:38.052 --> 00:06:40.203
Right, DRock? All right, 
you know, win a free crown,

00:06:40.203 --> 00:06:42.037
if you subscribe to this show.

00:06:42.426 --> 00:06:44.724
That's not gonna do me any
good if you really care

00:06:44.724 --> 00:06:46.282
about gold crowns.

00:06:46.292 --> 00:06:47.964
And the amount of people
that built their fan bases

00:06:47.964 --> 00:06:51.987
on Youtube, excuse me, on
Facebook, in 2009 and ten,

00:06:51.987 --> 00:06:55.087
by offering free iPads was insanity.

00:06:55.087 --> 00:06:57.594
Because those were Apple
fans, they weren't fans

00:06:57.594 --> 00:06:58.811
of your cereal.

00:06:58.811 --> 00:07:01.623
So I think Facebook, once
again, is making a hardcore

00:07:01.623 --> 00:07:05.361
move that is actually helping
the users and the businesses.

