and somebody I cared about,

00:07:36.135 --> 00:07:38.602
it actually quietly made
me check it out more.

00:07:38.602 --> 00:07:40.936
We did an AMA with my book.

00:07:42.968 --> 00:07:45.290
We're trying to do one
right now for social media.

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:46.335
- [Steve] Our social media.

00:07:46.335 --> 00:07:48.169
- Yup, our social media, so
we're gonna try to do that

00:07:48.169 --> 00:07:49.040
in September.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.537
I got an email in my inbox.

00:07:50.537 --> 00:07:52.214
I know you've been asking this, my fault.

00:07:52.214 --> 00:07:53.881
Do I find it useful?

00:07:53.881 --> 00:07:55.866
The question is, are you asking me as Gary

00:07:55.866 --> 00:07:57.352
the human being, do I find it useful?

00:07:57.352 --> 00:07:59.192
The answer is, not that
much because I'm not taking

00:07:59.192 --> 00:08:01.915
advantage of that amazing world
that's been created there.

00:08:02.234 --> 00:08:04.939
Do I find it useful as a marketing tool,

00:08:04.939 --> 00:08:08.266
I have looked at it that way,
and feel like it's a very

00:08:08.266 --> 00:08:10.605
interesting place because
that community is very solid,

00:08:10.605 --> 00:08:12.503
you don't want to jump in and spam.

00:08:12.503 --> 00:08:14.570
Reddit's done a nice job
creating some advertising

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:17.240
structure that I think is
consumable to the community

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:18.970
and good for the brands,
it's up to the brands

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:21.373
and their creative shops
to make it Reddit-y.

00:08:22.337 --> 00:08:24.311
And I think a lot of
people struggle with that.

00:08:24.311 --> 00:08:27.550
But if you understand the
slang, the lingo, the vibe

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:30.011
of the that community, and
you can play on that space.

00:08:30.011 --> 00:08:33.889
I find it useful as a place
that business can be done.

00:08:34.138 --> 00:08:38.022
But business 2020, which
is really respecting

00:08:38.022 --> 00:08:41.597
the community, or you are
going to get annihilated.

